  "proof_route": "Actual componentwise differentials and multiplicative exterior norms for orthogonal source words prove the exact product Jacobian. Exact Borel representatives, Rademacher, null cylinders, injective area and Fubini prove Borel chart-rectangle masses. Compact 3.2.18 charts refine the printed 3.2.4 decomposition. Borel rectangle extremality and finite complements identify local whole measures in place of the printed final Daniell-functional uniqueness appeal. Both omitted products are null using genuine first-factor rectifiability; countable local agreement after arbitrary restriction glues the full measures. No ambient Radon property, new selected witness, private construction, external dependency or project axiom is assumed.",
